  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Daddy went to law school and could've been an architect",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Now he's turnin' sixty and wonders where the big dream went",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tucker never said a lot, two eyes down, a little luck",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Took it to the Ivies and never really knew for what",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And I, I bite my tongue ten times a day",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Half swear to God, I might just pray",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I got a lot to lose",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So I might as well lose it anyway",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And I, I manifested you would leave",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "So the day you did, I had you beat",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Three steps ahead of everythin'",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Lately, I wake up feelin' like",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"Oh, where does the time go?\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You never really know",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Til you're standing in the bathroom mirror like",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "\"No, shit, we got so close\"",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Hit me fast and slow",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Funny thing about nostalgia",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Didn't show up 'til I lost ya (Ooh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Didn't show up 'til I lost ya (Ooh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "My ma wasn't raised right, oh no, all she ever knew was guilt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Little did she know that's all her kids would ever grow to feel",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And every choice leads back to the trait",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Every time that I drink and heart that I break",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It's a truckload of regret and stupid mistakes",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And, man, lately I wake up feelin' like",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
